    <problem>
      <list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
        <item>To the nearest hundredth, how many miles of 2-lane roads could the city resurface if it hires 6 new workers?
        </item>
      </list>
      <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! 20.8<br/>
        \(m=\frac{1,962,800-36,000(6)}{84,000}\)<br/>
        \(m=\frac{1,962,800-216,00084,000}{84,000}\) <br/>
        \(m=20.8\)
      </para>
